**9. General Fixture (Over-broad Setup)** — `setUp()` (line 19)

The `rng` field is initialized in `@BeforeEach` but never used by *any* test method. Every test pays the cost of an unnecessary `Random` allocation.

**Fix:** Remove the `rng` field and its initialization from `setUp()`.

