**10. Ignored/Disabled Test** — `disabledTest()` (line 109)

`@Disabled("flaky, fix later")` — no tracking reference. This will likely remain disabled indefinitely.

**Fix:** Either fix the flakiness (the test itself is trivially correct) or link to a tracking issue: `@Disabled("Tracked by #1234")`. If unfixable, delete it.

